      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider, I will use the Perspective API by Jigsaw. This API is designed to detect toxic and inappropriate content. I will import the necessary library and use the API endpoint to score the text. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the API endpoint URL. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
